        "en": "Supportive doctors and welcoming reception"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners in South Loop praise Dr. Sharpe, Dr. Megan, and Dr. Stricker alongside reception coordinator Justin for thoughtful and patient care. While one walk-in visitor reported a distressing customer service encounter, most regular clients describe a compassionate and family-like hospital environment."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear coordination and proactive advocacy"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers highlight prompt updates and thorough treatment discussions during complex medical journeys. Clients emphasize that clinicians advocate directly with insurers, coordinate seamlessly with outside oncologists, and offer detailed specialty referral options when emergency surgery is required."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 5,
      "title": {
        "en": "Low-stress techniques and gentle care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners commend the clinic for accommodating anxious animals using Fear Free techniques. Clients note that staff maintain physical barriers in waiting areas to reduce pet stress, completing exams, blood draws, and vaccinations efficiently without requiring heavy sedation for frightened dogs."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the clinic accommodate pets with severe vet anxiety?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, pet parents report that clinicians use Fear Free methods, gentle pacing, and physical barriers in clinic spaces to keep anxious dogs and cats calm during procedures."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are clinicians available on weekends?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The hospital is closed on Sundays and maintains limited weekend hours, prompting several clients to suggest calling ahead or utilizing local emergency hospitals when weekend care is needed."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the staff assist with outside specialty referrals?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, clients note that reception and clinical staff actively assist in locating specialized imaging centers and coordinate directly with regional veterinary oncologists."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
